! Proposed Definitions And Examples

{BOX()}
!! mu'e (NU1)

!!! Proposed Definition
mu'e is an event abstractor with the place structure x1 is a point event of (the bridi). It takes a bridi and wraps it into an event that is considered a single point in time, devoid of internal structure.

!!! Proposed Keywords
* point event abstractor

!!! See Also
* {nu}
* {co'i}

!!! Examples of ''mu'e'' Usage
;.i le mu'e le cribe lanzu cu klamu'o le tersla cu pu'o lerci: The arrival of the bear family at the party was before they were late (le la BERenstein. cribe .e. le jinga guzmrkukurbita)

{BOX}

{BOX()}
!! pu'u (NU1)

!!! Proposed Definition
pu'u is an event abstractor with the place structure: x1 is a process of (the bridi) with stages x2. It takes a bridi and wraps it into an event considered as a process having a beginning, an internal structure and an end.

!!! Proposed Keywords
* process event abstractor

!!! See Also
* {nu}

!!! Examples of 'pu'u''' Usage
;.i mi tcidu lo pu'u pilno zo je .e ro da poi simsa: I'm reading the uses of 'je' and all things similar (IRC, kribacr, 12 Jul 2009 11:35:37)
{BOX}


{BOX()}
!! za'i (NU1)

!!! Proposed Definition
pu'u is an event abstractor with the place structure: x1 is a process of (the bridi) with stages x2. It takes a bridi and wraps it into an event considered as a process having a beginning, an internal structure and an end. 
za'i is the event abstractor with the place structure: x1 is a continuous state of (the bridi) being true. It takes a bridi and wraps it into an event considered as a state. States have sharply defined natural boundaries dividing when the state exists and when it doesn't.

!!! Proposed Keywords
* state event abstractor

!!! See Also
* {nu}

!!! Examples of ''za'i'' Usage
;ri pi'egre le canko gi'e bajra se ka'a lety. zdani di'o le cicricfoi ku gi'e nupre le za'i ba noroi cliva le cicricfoi: it leaps through the window and runs to the house in the wild forest and promises never to leave the forest (la teris. po'u lo tirxu cu vitke zi'o le barda tcadu)
{BOX}
